  I have uncovered the following bug in nethack PL7 running on a SUN 3/50:

   I began reading a plaid spellbook, when I was attacked by a monster.  The
message was 'You begin to memorize the runes.  You stop studying.--More--

   After killing the monster, I saved the game.  After resuming the game, the 
message was 'Finishing off plaid spellbook...'.  Unfortunately, using the \
command does not tell me what spell was contained in the plaid spellbook.
Also, using the + command, the spell is not listed as a currently known spell.

   I have experimented with this in Wizard mode :-) and found that spellbooks 
that are identified will still be shown with the \ command, but do not appear 
as known spells.

   Hope this is enough to reproduce the bug.  Thanks for a great game.

